---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Our Story" description="Sugar Krewe makes small-batch, New Orleans inspired gummies in Metairie, Louisiana. Not a factory — just real people making real good gummies.">
  <section class="wrap narrow section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow gold">OUR STORY</p>
      <h1 class="section-title big">BORN IN THE<br /><span class="purple">BAYOU</span></h1>
    </div>
    <div class="panel prose">
      <p>Sugar Krewe was born from a simple love — the love of New Orleans culture, food, and the incredible energy of this one-of-a-kind city.</p>
      <p>Every product is inspired by something real — the jazz echoing down Bourbon Street, the swampy magic of the bayou, the explosion of color at Mardi Gras. We do not make boring candy. We make experiences.</p>
      <p>Made in small batches right here in Metairie, Louisiana. Not a factory. Just real people making real good gummies for a real good time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="callout">
      <div class="why-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎷</div>
      <h2 class="gold">LAISSEZ LES BONS TEMPS ROULER</h2>
      <p class="muted">Let the good times roll — it is the Sugar Krewe way</p>
      <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/shop">SHOP THE KREWE</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
